1. 01_inner_join.sql
-- INNER JOIN
-- Only matching records


SELECT students.name, courses.course_name
FROM students
INNER JOIN enrollments
    ON students.student_id = enrollments.student_id
INNER JOIN courses
    ON enrollments.course_id = courses.course_id;

Meaning: Course lo enrolled unna students matrame display avutaaru.

2. 02_left_join.sql
-- LEFT JOIN
-- All students + matching courses


SELECT students.name, courses.course_name
FROM students
LEFT JOIN enrollments
    ON students.student_id = enrollments.student_id
LEFT JOIN courses
    ON enrollments.course_id = courses.course_id;

Meaning: Course lekapoyina every student display avutadu.

3. 03_right_join.sql
-- RIGHT JOIN
-- All departments + matching employees


SELECT employees.name, departments.department_name
FROM employees
RIGHT JOIN departments
    ON employees.employee_id = departments.employee_id;

Meaning: Employee lekapoyina every department display avutundi.

4. 04_full_outer_join_concept.sql

MySQL lo direct FULL OUTER JOIN support cheyyadu. So UNION use chesi same concept achieve cheyyachu.

-- FULL OUTER JOIN using UNION in MySQL


SELECT customers.name, orders.product
FROM customers
LEFT JOIN orders
    ON customers.customer_id = orders.customer_id


UNION


SELECT customers.name, orders.product
FROM customers
RIGHT JOIN orders
    ON customers.customer_id = orders.customer_id;

Meaning: Both tables lo unna matching + non-matching records include avutayi.

5. 05_three_table_join.sql

Mana main practice:

students
    ↓
enrollments
    ↓
courses

Code:

-- Three-table JOIN


SELECT students.name, courses.course_name
FROM students
INNER JOIN enrollments
    ON students.student_id = enrollments.student_id
INNER JOIN courses
    ON enrollments.course_id = courses.course_id;

Relationships:

students.student_id = enrollments.student_id


enrollments.course_id = courses.course_id
6. 06_find_no_match.sql

Students course enroll avvakapothe find cheyyadaniki:

-- Find students who have NOT enrolled in any course


SELECT students.name
FROM students
LEFT JOIN enrollments
    ON students.student_id = enrollments.student_id
WHERE enrollments.student_id IS NULL;

Important pattern:

LEFT JOIN
+
WHERE related_table.id IS NULL

👉 Related record leni records ni find cheyyadaniki use chestam.

